# Flagging a Today entry with ! lists it in the Flagged view; mf there unflags it and it leaves, while the Today view keeps it.
file <<END
Work:
	- Write report @due({today})
	- Review PRs
END
keys gt !
keys gF
see - Write report 󰈻  Work
keys mf
hide Write report
keys gt
see - Write report  Work
quit
saved <<END
Work:
	- Write report @due({today})
	- Review PRs
END
